		// SlotHorimono: Horimono
		// EmptyName: (vacant)
		// EmptyHintNakago: The tang bears no name — this slot sits empty, granting no boon and charging no price. Pick a chisel print and cut one in; that is what gives the blade its temper
		// EmptyHintHi: No groove opened. Each groove cut is a measure of weight gone
