		// NoteArmsNoStock: No original of that weapon in the hoard, so the shade can't take shape
		// TalisTitle: Raincall Rope
		// TalisEmptyLine: An empty knot — click to open the talisman case
		// TalisNoneOwned: The talisman case is empty; craft a talisman at a workbench by the water first
